(Down) 憧れだけ (down) 夢を見る まだ見ぬ 恋路を追いかけて
(Down) Only yearning dreams of it (down), chasing the path of love I've yet to see.

110
00:17:17,130 --> 00:17:23,070
追いかけて またオトナブルー
Chasing it, once again Otona Blue.

111
00:17:23,070 --> 00:17:41,064
オトナブルー
Otona Blue

112
00:17:42,041 --> 00:17:45,461
Guuh! Huph! Grrr...! やばいめっちゃ疲れた！
Guuh! Huph! Grrr...! Man, I'm so exhausted!

113
00:17:45,961 --> 00:17:47,081
Nooo I lost again! やだ…また負けちゃった！
Nooo I lost again! No... I lost again!

114
00:17:47,321 --> 00:17:50,141
[Text: ICHIGO MILK] Wow talk about skill issue... わお…スキルの問題ね…
[Text: ICHIGO MILK] Wow talk about skill issue... Wow... What a skill issue...

115
00:17:50,141 --> 00:17:52,611
This is not about skill issue これはスキルの問題じゃない
This is not about skill issue. This isn't a skill issue!

116
00:17:52,611 --> 00:17:53,861
カエラが上手すぎるだけ…
It's just that Kaela is too good...

117
00:17:53,861 --> 00:17:58,041
Hehe, you'll get the hang of it senpai~ 先輩も練習すればできるささ～
Hehe, you'll get the hang of it senpai~ Senpai, if you practice, you'll get the hang of it!

118
00:17:58,191 --> 00:18:02,891
Oh yeah, didn't you have something you wanted to talk to us about? そういえば、先ほど聞きたいことがあって探してたんじゃなかったっけ？
Oh yeah, didn't you have something you wanted to talk to us about? Come to think of it, weren't you looking for us earlier because you wanted to ask something?

119
00:18:03,331 --> 00:18:06,731
Oh! Right! I got so reeled into the game that I forgot! そうそう！夢中になりすぎて忘れちゃった！
Oh! Right! I got so reeled into the game that I forgot! That's right! I got so caught up in it I completely forgot!

120
00:18:06,731 --> 00:18:12,821
There's something that I'm curious about and I wanted to ask you guys 相談したいことがあってあなたたちを探してただよ
There's something that I'm curious about and I wanted to ask you guys. I wanted to consult with you, which is why I was looking for you guys.

121
00:18:13,231 --> 00:18:17,131
Ask us? なんの相談なの？ レストランについて？ おいしいところたくさん知ってるよ！
Ask us? What kind of consultation? About restaurants? I know lots of delicious places!

122
00:18:17,131 --> 00:18:29,901
Noooo... 違う… 私って… 最近自分のことよくわからなくて、存在する理由すらわからない…
Noooo... That's not it... I... lately I don't really understand myself, I don't even know the reason for my existence...

123
00:18:29,901 --> 00:18:34,991
とりま考えてみれば いわてみれば確実に... いや、今まで理由がわからないままにね...
Come to think of it, thinking about it... Yeah, without ever knowing the reason...

124
00:18:34,991 --> 00:18:39,761
Yeah... So any guesses? うん…なぜだと思う？
Yeah... So any guesses? Yeah... Why do you think that is?

125
00:18:39,761 --> 00:18:46,471
Maybe your body is just bored of being buried? I don't know though お墓で暇だからつらい生返ったとか？本当の理由はわからないけど…
Maybe your body is just bored of being buried? I don't know though... Maybe because you were bored in your grave and came back to life? I don't really know the real reason though...

126
00:18:46,471 --> 00:18:53,711
I think she holds a grude もしかしたら恨みがあって死んだ後の世界で平和を感じることができないからだと思ふ…
I think she holds a grudge... Maybe she holds a grudge and can't feel peace in the afterlife...

127
00:18:53,711 --> 00:18:58,811
Huh, never really saw that way 確かに、そこまで考えたことないかも…
Huh, never really saw it that way. True, I guess I never thought about it that much...

128
00:18:58,811 --> 00:19:08,641
What about you Moona-senpai, what do you think? ムーナ先輩はどう思う？ 私？そうですね…
What about you Moona-senpai, what do you think? What about you, Moona-senpai? Me? Well...

129
00:19:08,641 --> 00:19:13,511
どんな理由であってさ あなたは私たちのオリーなんだからね…
Whatever the reason may be, you are still our Ollie, you know...

130
00:19:14,111 --> 00:19:24,111
Unless you turn out to be a- たとえば先輩が… あ、先輩の言いたいことは… どんな先輩でも私たちは友達ということが変わらない…
Unless you turn out to be a- What she means to say is... No matter what kind of senpai you are, you'll still be our friend...

131
00:19:24,111 --> 00:19:27,861
Aww thanks guys ララ…みんなありがとう！
Aww thanks guys. Aww... thanks everyone!

132
00:19:27,861 --> 00:19:38,271
Well I'll- そしたらもう少し周りの人に聞いてみる！ がんばってね！ またね！ 手がかり見つかるといいね！ またね！もっか会うやろ、ローの…
Well I'll ask around a bit more! Good luck! See you! Hope you find some clues! See you! Hope we see you in the lore...

133
00:20:10,673 --> 00:20:15,273
[Title: サンドリヨン 
 Lyrics: orange Music: Dios／シグナルP]
[Title: Cendrillon 
 Lyrics: orange Music: Dios／Signal-P]

134
00:20:29,293 --> 00:20:34,333
朝まで踊る 夢だけ見せて 時計の鐘が解く魔法
Dancing until morning, showing only dreams as the clock's chime undoes the magic

135
00:20:34,773 --> 00:20:39,213
曖昧な指 誘う階段 三段飛ばしで跳ねていく
Ambiguous fingers invite me up the stairs, skipping three steps at a time

136
00:20:43,293 --> 00:20:48,173
馬車の中で震えてた
Trembling inside the carriage

137
00:20:48,473 --> 00:20:54,193
惨めな古着 廻り廻れ 夜の舞踏
Patched in wretched old clothes, spin and spin, the night's masquerade

138
00:20:56,293 --> 00:21:00,753
見知らぬ顔探す 囁くあの声が
Searching for unfamiliar faces, that whispering voice

139
00:21:00,993 --> 00:21:06,993
握り締めた刃 突き立て 全てを奪えと
Plunging the blade I gripped tight, telling me to take everything

140
00:21:09,993 --> 00:21:15,613
孤児集う城 笑み 仮面に描いて
A castle where orphans gather, drawing smiles upon our masks

141
00:21:16,493 --> 00:21:21,973
偽りの慈しみさえ 羽根で包むセラフ
Even false affection, embraced by the seraph's wings

142
00:21:35,493 --> 00:21:40,973
灰の中で赤く 溶けて交じるガラスの靴
Melting red amidst the ashes, the glass slipper mixing in

143
00:21:48,893 --> 00:21:54,753
今更帰る 震えているの あなたが目をやる時計
Returning now, trembling at the clock you are looking at

144
00:21:55,293 --> 00:22:02,213
靴脱ぎ踊る スロープ抜けて ここまで伸びる指の先で
Taking off shoes and dancing past the slope, right up to the tips of my fingers reaching here

145
00:22:03,293 --> 00:22:08,613
すくう雫 口付けて 走る衝動 背骨抜けてゆく刹那
Kissing the cupped droplet, the rushing impulse piercing straight through my spine in that instant

146
00:22:16,193 --> 00:22:22,213
鐘は鳴らさないで あなたに跪き
Do not ring the bell, kneeling before you

147
00:22:22,493 --> 00:22:29,693
まだダメと叫んだ右手が 突き刺さるサヨナラ
The right hand that shouted 'Not yet!' pierces through with a farewell

148
00:22:35,993 --> 00:22:42,613
消せない硝煙を 香水にまとう姫
A princess wearing unerasable gunpowder smoke as perfume

149
00:22:49,093 --> 00:22:55,513
強い瞳 僕の凍った仮面ごと打ち抜く
With fierce eyes, shattering even my frozen mask

150
00:23:00,093 --> 00:23:08,213
今も 耳にあなたの吐息が 突き刺さるの 遠い夢
Even now, your sigh pierces my ears—a distant dream

151
00:23:14,693 --> 00:23:20,993
ステンドグラス越し 光る月が 君に被せたベール
The shining moon through the stained glass cast a veil over you

152
00:23:28,093 --> 00:23:34,993
ドレス 膝で咲いて ティアラは投げ捨てて 見つめ合う瞳と瞳が 火花を放つ
Dresses bloom at the knees, tiaras are cast aside, and gazing eyes spark with fire

153
00:23:38,093 --> 00:23:47,513
孤独な魂が 炎あげ惹かれあう その涙救えないなら まるで一人遊び
Lonely souls raise flames and draw to each other; if those tears cannot be saved, it's like playing alone

154
00:23:55,093 --> 00:24:00,693
時よ止まれ 今は あなたに酔いしれて 揺れる鼓動 一つ一つを刻みつけてたい
O time, stop now; intoxicated by you, I want to carve every single swaying heartbeat into my memory

155
00:24:00,893 --> 00:24:08,093
とどまれ 熱く濡れ 打ち付ける高まりに これ以上は動けないよ まるでフェアリーテイル
Stay, hot and drenched, against the pounding surge; I can't move any more than this, just like a fairytale.

156
00:24:27,930 --> 00:24:31,370
Zzzzz... Zzzzz... Hmm..? Huh..?

157
00:24:32,050 --> 00:24:33,810
えっ... な... み...
W-Wh... A...

158
00:24:33,950 --> 00:24:36,270
みやび先輩?! あ、目が覚めたんだね。おはよう。
Miyabi-senpai?! Ah, you're awake. Good morning.

159
00:24:38,190 --> 00:24:40,670
み、みやび先輩?! ここで何してるの?
M-Miyabi-senpai?! What are you doing here?!

160
00:24:41,670 --> 00:24:44,830
今日は僕もスタジオでのダンスリハーサルがあるんだ。
I have dance rehearsal in the studio today too.

161
00:24:45,050 --> 00:24:49,330
歩いてたら道端で寝ているオリーを見つけて...
And then I found you sleeping here on the side of the road...

162
00:24:48,180 --> 00:24:53,280
[Text: (AAAH MALU BANGET!!) (BERARTI TADI MIYABI-SENPAI LIAT AKU TIDUR DONG?!)]
[Text: (GAAH I CAN'T BELIEVE IT!!) (I SHOWED MY SLEEPING FACE TO MIYABI-SENPAI?!)]

163
00:24:54,090 --> 00:24:56,530
オリーはなんでここで寝ていたの?
And what about you? Why are you sleeping here?

164
00:24:57,250 --> 00:24:58,810
おっ... うっ...
Oh... Uh...

165
00:25:00,192 --> 00:25:01,542
Ceritanya agak panjang sih...
It's kind of a long story...

166
00:25:02,092 --> 00:25:05,872
Jadi akhir-akhir ini Ollie kepikiran sama alasan kenapa Ollie menjadi zombie...
I've been thinking about my origins... You know, the reason to why I became a zombie...

167
00:25:06,282 --> 00:25:07,012
Ah

168
00:25:07,012 --> 00:25:09,712
Emang kamu bangun dari kubur karena rumah kamu jadi toko ramen?
Isn't it because you sensed that your house turned into a ramen shop? Or so I heard

169
00:25:10,322 --> 00:25:10,932
Bukan senpai
That was actually a coincidence

170
00:25:11,232 --> 00:25:14,752
Itu kebetulan aja pas Ollie bangun rumah Ollie jadi toko ramen...
I happen to wake up and it already was a ramen shop...

171
00:25:15,212 --> 00:25:15,922
Terus..
And you know?

172
00:25:16,692 --> 00:25:19,532
Semakin Ollie pikirin eksistensi Ollie..
The more I think about my existence...

173
00:25:20,112 --> 00:25:22,522
Semakin Ollie mikirin takdir Ollie...
The more I think about fate...

174
00:25:23,052 --> 00:25:25,692
Kenapa takdir membangunkan Ollie?
Why did it make me live, I wonder?

175
00:25:26,142 --> 00:25:29,712
Apa cerita Ollie belum tamat habis meninggal?
Why is my grave not the end of my chapter? Can't help it...

176
00:25:30,112 --> 00:25:31,352
Ternyata Ollie lagi mikirin ini ya...
I see, so you've been having those thoughts...

177
00:25:31,522 --> 00:25:33,822
Pasti sulit ya...
It must be hard for you to think about

178
00:25:34,072 --> 00:25:38,842
Tapi tahu gak sih? Kadang hal-hal seperti ini malah lebih baik dibiarkan apa adanya
But you know, sometimes there are things that are best left as is...

179
00:25:39,032 --> 00:25:43,282
Jadi nggak usah dipikirin nanti jawabannya juga dateng sendiri kok...
I don't think you need to ponder too much about it, surely the answer will come to you on its own...

180
00:25:44,092 --> 00:25:46,502
Iyo juga ya... Benar juga...
You know what, you're right senpai...

181
00:25:47,092 --> 00:25:48,432
Ngapain ya buru-buru...
I shouldn't rush too much...

182
00:25:49,172 --> 00:25:51,582
Kalau memang takdir nanti juga tahu...
Surely I'll find out sooner or later!

183
00:25:52,322 --> 00:25:53,792
Baguslah kalau mengerti...
I'm glad I got to help you...

184
00:25:54,222 --> 00:25:56,942
Yak kalo gitu senpai duluan ya, senpai harus latihan...
Anyways, I have dance practice so I better take my leave now

185
00:25:57,162 --> 00:26:00,082
Baik! Terima kasih banyak senpai!
I will! Thank you so much senpai!

186
00:26:00,282 --> 00:26:01,542
Jaga diri ya, Ollie!
Take care, Ollie!

187
00:26:02,202 --> 00:26:04,692
Senpai benar... Senpai keliru-eh maksudnya senpai benar...
He's right... Senpai is right...

188
00:26:05,212 --> 00:26:10,012
Aku gak usah banyak pikiran... Nanti waktunya juga dateng kok...
I shouldn't think about it too much... I should just take my time...

189
00:26:15,619 --> 00:26:20,239
Padahal akhirnya... aku bukannya dapat jawaban, malah ngabuburit kemana-mana.
In the end, I just wasted my day looking for an answer that I don't even know exists...

190
00:26:21,179 --> 00:26:25,359
Tapi senpai sampai aku tinggal lagi. Jadi gak enak aku...
I feel bad for bailing on dance practice with lofi-senpai, I gotta apologize later...

191
00:26:27,229 --> 00:26:30,439
Jawabannya bakal datang sendiri... Hah...
"The answer will come to me sooner or later," huh...

192
00:26:31,159 --> 00:26:35,399
Iyaa... moga-moga jawabannya gak ngaret datangnya. Keburu meninggal lagi aku.
I hope I won't have to wait too long that I get revived a second time...

193
00:26:36,129 --> 00:26:39,199
Andai ya dapat petunjuk sedikit aja.
If only there were some sort of clue...

194
00:26:41,229 --> 00:26:44,479
Itu... bunga kah? Kok tumbuhnya di pinggir jalan sih? Aneh.
Is that a flower? What's it doing growing at a busy street like this? How weird.

195
00:26:48,969 --> 00:26:51,199
Ini tuh bukan tempat kamu, bunga kecil.
This isn't your place little daisy.

196
00:26:51,779 --> 00:26:53,739
Kamu seharusnya tumbuh di tempat lain.
You belong somewhere else where...

197
00:26:54,159 --> 00:26:57,269
Kalau tumbuhnya di sini, yang ada kamu malah layu...
If you were to stay, then you'll only wilt...

198
00:27:04,699 --> 00:27:06,529
Barusan... apa yang...
W-What... Just... Happened...?

199
00:27:07,129 --> 00:27:08,969
Nya... Nya... Mekar?
It... Bloomed..

200
00:27:16,989 --> 00:27:19,059
Barusan... Apaan?
What in the world...

201
00:27:19,439 --> 00:27:21,999
Yang barusan tuh... aku?
Did... I do that...?

202
00:27:22,349 --> 00:27:25,199
Jadi... ini kah?
... Is this it...?

203
00:27:32,579 --> 00:27:37,589
Trust in me, I'll be back in the days

204
00:27:37,589 --> 00:27:42,369
Trust in me, I'll be back in the days

205
00:27:42,699 --> 00:27:47,979
アダムとイヴはどんな気持ちで手に取ったんだ？
With what kind of feeling did Adam and Eve pick it up?

206
00:27:48,109 --> 00:27:53,019
青くて苦くて僕は 囓って残りは全部捨てたんだ
It was blue and bitter, so I bit into it and threw away the rest

207
00:27:53,319 --> 00:27:58,429
だって理解できないから 身勝手許されないから
Because I can't understand, because selfishness isn't forgiven

208
00:27:58,429 --> 00:28:03,139
全部燃やし尽くして いつか笑える日まで Back in the days
Burn it all down until the day we can laugh again, back in the days

209
00:28:03,319 --> 00:28:08,059
Someday 生まれ落ちた生命 惑星 呪い尽くした所為で
Someday, a newborn life, because of cursing the planet completely...

210
00:28:08,159 --> 00:28:13,329
焼野原に見えてんだ？ かける言葉も見つかりやしないや
Does it look like a burnt field? I can't even find words to say

211
00:28:13,329 --> 00:28:18,369
星が砂に 変わってしまったんじゃない
It's not that the stars turned into sand

212
00:28:18,369 --> 00:28:22,879
僕の心が 砂で出来ていたんだ
It's that my heart was made of sand

213
00:28:23,049 --> 00:28:30,439
誰もが置き去りにした世界で はじまりの歌を歌い続ける
In a world where everyone was left behind, I'll keep singing the song of beginnings

214
00:28:30,749 --> 00:28:36,659
もう わかってたんだ ひどくしゃがれた声を上げれば また君に会える気がした
I already knew, if I raised my terribly hoarse voice, I felt like I could meet you again

215
00:28:36,969 --> 00:28:44,299
ねぇ 聞こえてるでしょう？
Hey, you can hear it, right?

216
00:28:44,299 --> 00:28:52,599
(Trust in me, I'll be back in the days)

217
00:28:52,599 --> 00:28:59,929
ぼくら魔法に期待しながら 魔法使いを嫌っていた
While hoping for magic, we hated wizards

218
00:29:00,049 --> 00:29:08,299
都合のいい世界だけを 望んで生きている 矛盾まみれの人生論と 歩いてきた四半世紀
Living wishing only for a convenient world, I've walked a quarter-century with a life theory full of contradictions

219
00:29:08,409 --> 00:29:13,719
掛け違えたボタンを 笑える日が来るなら
If a day will come when I can laugh even at misbuttoned buttons

220
00:29:13,919 --> 00:29:18,759
誰もが置き去りにした世界で
In a world where everyone was left behind

221
00:29:18,759 --> 00:29:22,599
はじまりの歌を歌い続ける
I'll keep singing the song of beginnings

222
00:29:22,599 --> 00:29:30,599
もう わかっていたんだ ひどくしゃがれた声を上げれば また君に会える気がした
I already knew, if I raised my terribly hoarse voice, I felt like I could meet you again

223
00:29:30,599 --> 00:29:38,349
ねぇ 聞こえているんでしょう？
Hey, you can hear it, right?

224
00:29:38,349 --> 00:29:52,599
(Trust in me, I'll be back in the days)

225
00:30:00,432 --> 00:30:05,052
誰もが置き去りにした世界で
In a world everyone left behind,

226
00:30:05,232 --> 00:30:09,692
はじまりの歌を歌い続ける
I'll keep on singing the song of beginnings.

227
00:30:09,692 --> 00:30:14,712
もうわかってたんだ
I already knew,

228
00:30:15,152 --> 00:30:20,192
ひどくしゃがれた声を上げれば
if I raised my terribly hoarse voice,

229
00:30:20,432 --> 00:30:24,192
また君に会える気がした
I felt I could meet you once more.

230
00:30:24,532 --> 00:30:27,252
ねえ 聞こえてるでしょう？
Hey, can you hear me?

231
00:30:32,652 --> 00:30:43,192
初めて出会ったんだ 鏡の中の自分に 巡りめぐる今日を 溶かしていく温度
For the very first time, I met the self in the mirror, a temperature melting away the revolving days.

232
00:32:11,892 --> 00:32:14,472
アンデッドアリスへ
To Undead Alice,

233
00:32:24,272 --> 00:32:29,912
「思うように逝けないなら 私を吸って君は生きて」
"If you can't pass away as you wish, suck me in and live on."

234
00:32:29,912 --> 00:32:35,152
狂ってんだ 君の残響は 僕じゃなくたって 聴こえるのに
You're mad, your lingering echo is heard even if it's not by me.

235
00:32:35,152 --> 00:32:41,032
自傷案を募るたびに 幸せ吸って 毒を吐いて
Every time I gather self-harm plans, I breathe in happiness and spew poison.

236
00:32:41,352 --> 00:32:46,512
理想ジャンキー 二人だけが 正常なんて気持ちいいじゃんか
Ideal junkies, isn't it great that only the two of us are normal?

237
00:32:46,512 --> 00:32:51,632
会いたい誤魔化したい病が 会えなくて溢れ出すローが 仲良くなっちゃって やっぱつらいや
The illness of wanting to see you, wanting to brush it off, the low feelings overflowing because we can't meet became friends, and it's still painful.

238
00:32:51,632 --> 00:32:56,772
ドキドキが厭になって 僕が君を殺す前に 死んでくれ
My heartbeat becomes unbearable, before I kill you, please die.

239
00:32:57,112 --> 00:33:02,152
ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ 壊していいよ 怖くていいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to be scared.

240
00:33:02,152 --> 00:33:07,572
卑怯な愛はここに埋めよう 忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう
Let's bury cowardly love right here, let's forget this and stop doing this already.

241
00:33:07,572 --> 00:33:13,592
嫌ったほうが 気楽でいい でも 想ったほうが重くていいじゃんか
It's easier to just hate, but isn't it fine if caring feels heavy?

242
00:33:13,592 --> 00:33:19,272
もう笑えない僕の アンデッドアリスへ
To my Undead Alice who can no longer smile.

243
00:33:22,352 --> 00:33:26,892
予想通り 僕の夢が 輝くほど 君は陰っていく
As expected, the more my dreams shine, the more you are overshadowed.

244
00:33:27,132 --> 00:33:32,072
犠牲を 我慢と呼んで 汚れた手で 撫で回した
Calling sacrifice patience, I stroked you with tainted hands.

245
00:33:32,592 --> 00:33:37,512
悪いようにしないように それがつまり悪い形
Trying not to do evil, that in short is an evil shape.

246
00:33:37,972 --> 00:33:42,692
保存状態 愛は冷凍で 何度も聞いた 「あたためますか？」
Preserved state, love is frozen, how many times have I heard "Would you like that warmed up?"

247
00:33:42,972 --> 00:33:48,472
正しくありたい本能が 正しくないことの脂肪が 仲良くなっちゃって やっぱつらいや
The instinct to want to be right and the fat of what's not right became friends, and it's still painful after all.

248
00:33:48,472 --> 00:33:52,672
なあなあが癖になって 僕が僕を殺す前に 死んでやる
Complacency became a habit, before I kill myself, I'll die.

249
00:33:52,932 --> 00:33:58,052
ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ 壊していいよ 怖くていいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to be scared.

250
00:33:58,052 --> 00:34:03,132
卑怯な愛はここに埋めよう 忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう
Let's bury cowardly love right here, let's forget this and stop doing this already.

251
00:34:03,132 --> 00:34:09,232
嫌ったほうが 気楽でいい でも 想ったほうが重くていいじゃんか
It's easier to just hate, but isn't it fine if caring feels heavy?

252
00:34:09,232 --> 00:34:14,732
もう笑えない僕の アンデッドアリスへ
To my Undead Alice who can no longer smile.

253
00:34:27,292 --> 00:34:32,332
ずっとこのまま、ふたりで夢を見れるって
That we could keep dreaming together just like this,

254
00:34:32,772 --> 00:34:37,912
勝手ばかりで、君はどんな顔で笑っていたっけ
being so selfish, what kind of face were you smiling with?

255
00:34:35,612 --> 00:34:49,312
まあまあツライじゃん 胸を割いて愛を潰してくれよ
It's pretty painful, isn't it? Tear open my chest and crush my love.

256
00:34:38,332 --> 00:34:43,312
バイバイしたから 元通りなんて幻想だ
The idea that things are back to normal since we said goodbye is an illusion.

257
00:34:51,792 --> 00:35:00,112
ずるしていいよ ずるくていいよ 壊していいよ 怖くていいよ
It's okay to cheat, it's okay to be sly, it's okay to break things, it's okay to be scared.

258
00:35:00,256 --> 00:35:02,226
忘れるんだこんなのもうやめよう
Forget this, let's stop already.

259
00:35:02,396 --> 00:35:04,756
嫌ったほうが 気楽でいい
It's easier to just hate it.

260
00:35:05,266 --> 00:35:08,336
でも 想ったほうが重くていいじゃんか
But isn't it fine if these feelings are heavy?

261
00:35:08,896 --> 00:35:11,366
もう笑えない僕の
To my self that can no longer smile...

262
00:35:12,316 --> 00:35:15,826
アンデッドアリス なんだっていいよ
Undead Alice, whatever is fine.

263
00:35:15,826 --> 00:35:20,016
痛いくらいじゃ 逝けそうもないや 時効くらいじゃ 消えそうもないや
Not even pain makes it seem like I can pass on. Not even the statute of limitations makes it seem like I'll fade away.

264
00:35:20,256 --> 00:35:23,136
ごめんねなんて言えるはずない
There's no way I can say 'I'm sorry'.

265
